---
description: Unit, integration, and e2e tests required with behavior changes
alwaysApply: true
---

# Testing

- A behavior change ships a unit test.
- A boundary crossing ships an integration test against that boundary.
- A user-visible flow change ships an end-to-end test. Web uses Playwright. A native device run is required when the flow cannot be proven on web.
- Do not skip or delete a test to get a change merged. Fix the test or narrow the change.
- Temporary databases and fake providers are the default. Tests do not call a paid model or a production project.
